@TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5106

### List all tasks
GET {{TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Create a task
POST {{TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the README",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### A task without a title is rejected (400)
POST {{TaskManagerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}
